" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 기간</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>2013. 9. 9(월) ～ 9. 11(수), 14:00-20:00</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 장소</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>관리동 1층 탁구장</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 방법</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 한국건강관리협회 경상북도지부에서 방문 검진</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 추후 검진결과표는 각 동 우편함에서 수신(반송불가, 개별 폐기바람)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong></strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -25pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 25pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. 비용</span></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 무료 (검진비 5,000원 생활관에서 지원, 학생 부담 없음)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 주의사항</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> : 선택이 아닌 필수 사항이오니 위 기간 동안 반드시 검진 받으시기 바랍니다. (위 기간 내에 미 검진시, 외부 보건소 및 개인병원에서 비용을 개인이 지불하여 검진 후 결과서를 제출해야 함)</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2013. 9.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">금오공과대학교생활관</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
